{"id":"example_conv_01","chapter":"lti","topics":["convolution"],"difficulty":2,"question":"x(t)=e^{-2t}u(t), h(t)=e^{-t}u(t)，求 y(t)","solution":"支撑交集为 0≤τ≤t，积分得 (e^{-t}-e^{-2t})u(t)","pitfalls":["卷积边界","漏写 u(t)"]}
{"id":"example_z_roc_01","chapter":"z_transform","topics":["inverse_transform","roc"],"difficulty":2,"question":"只给 X(z)=z/(z-a) 求 x[n]","solution":"条件不足，需给 ROC；外侧和内侧 ROC 对应不同序列","pitfalls":["默认因果"]}
{"id":"example_period_dt_01","chapter":"signals","topics":["periodicity"],"difficulty":2,"question":"判断 x[n]=cos(3πn/5) 是否周期，并求基波周期","solution":"(3π/5)/(2π)=3/10 为有理数，最小周期 N=10","pitfalls":["套用连续时间结论","周期未取最小正整数"]}
{"id":"example_fs_01","chapter":"fourier_series","topics":["trigonometric_series","symmetry"],"difficulty":3,"question":"奇对称周期方波的三角 Fourier 级数中哪些系数必为零","solution":"直流分量与余弦系数为零，只保留正弦系数","pitfalls":["未先利用对称性","混淆半波对称与奇对称"]}
{"id":"example_ctft_scale_01","chapter":"fourier_transform","topics":["properties"],"difficulty":2,"question":"已知 x(t)↔X(jω)，求 x(2t) 的 Fourier 变换","solution":"由尺度性质得到 X(jω/2)/2","pitfalls":["漏掉 1/2 幅度因子"]}
{"id":"example_laplace_fvt_01","chapter":"laplace","topics":["final_value"],"difficulty":3,"question":"F(s)=1/[s(s-1)] 能否使用终值定理","solution":"不能，因为 sF(s) 在右半平面存在极点 s=1","pitfalls":["未检查极点直接令 s→0"]}
{"id":"example_sampling_01","chapter":"sampling","topics":["nyquist"],"difficulty":2,"question":"最高角频率为 8000π rad/s 的带限信号最低采样率是多少","solution":"fm=4000 Hz，因此 fs≥8000 Hz","pitfalls":["把 rad/s 直接当作 Hz"]}
{"id":"example_stability_01","chapter":"system_properties","topics":["stability"],"difficulty":2,"question":"h[n]=(1/2)^n u[n] 对应的 LTI 系统是否 BIBO 稳定","solution":"绝对和 Σ(1/2)^n=2 有限，因此稳定","pitfalls":["只检查 h[n] 是否趋于零"]}
{"id":"example_dt_conv_01","chapter":"lti","topics":["convolution"],"difficulty":2,"question":"x[n]={1,2}，h[n]={1,1}，两序列起点均为 0，求卷积","solution":"按有效下标逐项乘加，得到 y[n]={1,3,2}，起点为 0","pitfalls":["输出长度写错","忽略起点"]}
{"id":"example_unilateral_laplace_01","chapter":"laplace","topics":["initial_conditions","system_function"],"difficulty":3,"question":"用单边 Laplace 变换求解 y'(t)+2y(t)=0，y(0-)=1","solution":"sY(s)-1+2Y(s)=0，所以 Y(s)=1/(s+2)，y(t)=e^{-2t}u(t)","pitfalls":["漏写初值项","混用双边变换"]}
